  "body": "[SYN-384](https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-384) was accompanied with mysterious spikes of federation traffic which we couldn't properly analyse due to https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/1322.  The theory is that somehow matrix.org being overloaded caused other servers to send in their own presence updates in response to matrix.org user's presence dropping off, which caused some kind of presence storm.  Need more details on whether this is possible and stop it if it is.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-397)\n\n(Reported by @ara4n)",
